{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"小一入學自行分配學位結果下周一公布\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-11-20-23-21-52FhuLCWBW.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】小一入學自行分配學位結果下周一公布。</p><p>育局指，今年有32104名兒童申請公營小學自行分配學位，當中逾5成6、即18148人獲派位。</p><p>教育局提醒家長下周一上午10時起，可透過電子平台或前往所申請的小學查閱結果，並須於下周三或四學校辦公時間內，到申請的小學為子女辦理註冊手續。</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T15:43:56.694473+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T15:21:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T20:17:50.752051+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T15:37:29.587154+00:00","content_hash":"a2a7e4fbb086be67267767031f8c20baea2fc355547c8616b98b20a426d44007","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}